## Purpose
Use Cursor effectively and keep sessions focused.

## Applies When
- Project-wide Cursor usage guidance.

## In-Editor Rules
- Plan → Confirm → Code small, testable chunks; specify file(s) to edit.
- Use @Files/@Folders to include exact context when needed.
- Checkpoints: save often; revert if the agent drifts.
- Start fresh chats for new features to avoid context dilution.

## Rule Types & Precedence
- Prefer focused, composable rules; keep short; use globs to auto-attach relevant files.
